{"posts":[{"id":"supplydemand_p40_976","t":"Just shorted gold","a":"Eurotrash","d":"","n":"#976","p":40,"im":["65755a2ba1edca0d28c514d0c063cffbf2f3b31a","ad48a642b57c985f3086683124ba672c251cacc4","8205b80b0b7e54162b862c5018882b6c8cb64da9"],"m":976},{"id":"supplydemand_p40_977","t":"Gold looking good Eurotrash\n\nIm short AUDUSD","a":"Lehmann","d":"","n":"#977","p":40,"im":["325d3ad9de99a1b9d36f6f5820993bb9e5ae632a"],"m":977},{"id":"supplydemand_p40_978","t":"Closed half","a":"Eurotrash","d":"","n":"#978","p":40,"im":["427bd75c1248625cfcf4cfbb9fe0d935080b850c"],"m":978},{"id":"supplydemand_p40_979","t":"Lehmann wrote: Gold looking good Eurotrash\n\nIm short AUDUSD\n\nMoved stop to BE","a":"Lehmann","d":"","n":"#979","p":40,"im":["325d3ad9de99a1b9d36f6f5820993bb9e5ae632a","c9c96db507af5a3a45398fa0480b2ebc089715bc"],"m":979},{"id":"supplydemand_p40_980","t":"Cheers Lehmann, out of gold, flat on everything now, been a really good day.\n\nAUD and Gold often correlate somewhat, really nice trading!","a":"Eurotrash","d":"","n":"#980","p":40,"im":[],"m":980},{"id":"supplydemand_p40_981","t":"Some observations regarding decision points. EU recently highlights how important DPs are on all time frames. Price has just returned to DP1 and looks like it has cleanly violated it. DP 2 and DP 3 were respected. Both were tradeable. I took DP 3 today and backed up the truck for my pips.\n\nMoving to the H4 time frame DP4 and 5 were added. Even DP4 on lower time frame would have been tradeable. DP 5 occurred today.\n\nOn the H1 more dps appear.\n\nGoing to lower time frames will show even more. Decision points are great places to observe PA.\n\nJust noticed I posted wrong chart for H1. Anyway the point I think is made.","a":"Alientrader","d":"","n":"#981","p":40,"im":["7f396f3898bcae83c45cc029a41594ba486f6ae8","76acadb05a2746db97a91f9b8608deeed5b0731b"],"m":981},{"id":"supplydemand_p40_982","t":"Gold.","a":"kruger","d":"","n":"#982","p":40,"im":["28ecbec1ae16312a478d7f3b74fffd729b98644